# Bunnyhole API key template. Copy values into ~/.bunnyhole/api_keys.env (auto-created, chmod 600)
# via `bunnyhole keys --set NAME=VALUE`, or export them in your shell. Every key is OPTIONAL;
# Bunnyhole degrades gracefully to keyless public endpoints when a key is absent.

# --- AI synthesis & LLM Council (OpenRouter powers the multi-model Council) ---
